   "proposed": "改为“不做卿相不回卫国”/“until he became a minister or chancellor”"
  },
  {
   "id": "F11",
   "path": "sections.context.2",
   "category": "quotes",
   "severity": "fix",
   "problem": "「人」「账」用了「」，但不是证据引语，违反「」只用于逐字引文的规则。",
   "evidence": [],
